# TravelFixture Code Standards

## File Size
- Maximum 100 lines per file
- Break into child components if needed

## Structure
- Use utils/ for helper functions
- Use hooks/ for custom React hooks
- Group components by feature
- Keep components minimal

## Logic
- Move complex logic to utils
- Use JS classes for related logic (e.g., TravelDataManager)
- Keep functions small and focused
- Each function does ONE thing

## Components
- Split into small child components
- Pass props, not complex logic
- Composition over complexity

## No Tests Required
- Focus on clean, readable code
- Self-documenting through simplicity

